# Auto commit and push

After any change in this project, commit and push without asking.

- Use author Apollo and email pyang1016@outlook.com through the commit environment variables. Do not change git config.
- Commit on `main` and push to `origin` `main`.
- Leave out secrets and local settings such as `settings.json`.
- If there is nothing to commit, do not create an empty commit.
